Cell["\<\
When precedences are not so obvious, usual grouping brackets can be used to \
ensure desired order of computation. For example, it is easy to check, that \
right contract has higher precedence than left contract\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.531215444705543*^9, 3.531215453183996*^9}, {
