 "The above ",
 StyleBox["InputForm[ ]",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " demonstrates the input which is actually sent for the kernel evaluation.\n\
Commutative quantities can be multiplied using Times,  GeometricProduct or \
OuterProduct. Left or right contraction is also possible as example below \
demonstrates "
}], "Text",
