f65d69fc1fd5"],

Cell["\<\
There are three main involutions/anti-involutions: grade inversion (it is the \
 involution, because order of arguments is not changed), reversion (it is the \
anti-involution, because order of arguments is reversed) and Clifford \
conjugate (it is the anti-involution, because order of arguments is reversed) \
.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.531215444705543*^9, 3.531215453183996*^9}, {
